    "body": "Let's be more precise here than I was in [epoch-relative timestamp](https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-epoch-relative-timestamp):\r\n```suggestion\r\n   <li><p>Let <var>ns</var> be the number of nanoseconds from the <span>Unix epoch</span> to\r\n   <var>time</var>, rounded to the nearest integer.</p></li>\r\n```",
